msgstr "个及以上窗口"

#: greenTile.js:2982
msgid "Painter"
msgstr "布局绘制区"

#: greenTile.js:2997
msgid ""
"Click or drag: the row sets how many windows the column holds. Right-click "
"removes a column."
msgstr "单击或拖动：所在行决定该列容纳的窗口数。右键单击可删除一列。"

#: greenTile.js:3002
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: greenTile.js:3003
